      "statement": "Workspace creation records schemaVersion 1 and a typed result in state/workspace-seed.json and emits kast_workspace_seed progress. Outcomes are NOT_REQUESTED, SEEDED(donor), NO_ELIGIBLE_DONOR, DONORS_BUSY, UNSUPPORTED_FILESYSTEM, CLONE_FAILED(stage), SELECTION_REJECTED(failure) and CLEANUP_REJECTED(failure). Unsupported or failed cloning continues empty only after cleanup succeeds; cleanup rejection emits progress and aborts publication without a receipt. Cleanup re-admits the recipient private physical root before deletion, so an aliased root rejects publication without deleting its external target.",
